about: Binding notation registry (BUILDER_RULES §3.1-3.2). Pages may use only these macros; a registered symbol never takes another meaning. Builders request additions under NOTATION_REQUESTS. Only program-wide symbols are registered; letters whose meaning is conventionally local (alpha, beta, gamma, N, S, m, mu, sigma) are defined in each lesson where used.
